{"id":"263379658f1ae518","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral.md","title":"Stochastic Integral","display":"df-stochastic-integral — Stochastic Integral","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stochastic-integral","aliases":["58-df-stochastic-integral","Stochastic Integral"],"display":"df-stochastic-integral — Stochastic Integral","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-predictable.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stochastic-integral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stochastic-integral</span><span>Stochastic Integral</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stochastic-integral — Stochastic Integral"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md\">../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7934599233a4e10f\" href=\"?note=7934599233a4e10f\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-predictable.md\">../batch11/58-df-predictable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,H,Q,J,Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,m,u,h\\in V\">\\(B,H,Q,J,Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,m,u,h\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 使用逐时随机变量编码，积分被积函数使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\times\\Omega\">\\(T\\times\\Omega\\)</span> 上的有序对函数编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(s,w)\">\\(Q(s,w)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\langle s,w\\rangle)\">\\(Q(\\langle s,w\\rangle)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S\\)</span> 取自 <code>58-df-stochastic-integral-data</code>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{u(k)}=\\mathcal F_\\bullet(u(k))\">\\(\\mathcal F_{u(k)}=\\mathcal F_\\bullet(u(k))\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_A(s)=1\">\\(\\mathbf1_A(s)=1\\)</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in A\">\\(s\\in A\\)</span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_A(s)=0\">\\(\\mathbf1_A(s)=0\\)</span>。下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 下标均表示固定时间参数，不改变原七元和六元接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Predictable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Predictable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7934599233a4e10f\" href=\"?note=7934599233a4e10f\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-predictable.md\">../batch11/58-df-predictable.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md\">../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PredictableStepRepresentation}\">\\(\\mathrm{PredictableStepRepresentation}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PredictableStepRepresentation}_S(Q,m,u,h;\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;m\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s),\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall s,s&#39;\\in T\\;(s\\leq s&#39;\\to\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s&#39;))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,m+1,T)\\land\\forall k&lt;m\\;(u(k)&lt;u(k+1))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,m,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k&lt;m\\;\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(h(k);(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(u(k))),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q,T\\times\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\nQ(\\langle s,w\\rangle)=\\sum_{k&lt;m}h(k)(w)\\mathbf1_{(u(k),u(k+1)]}(s).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PredictableStepRepresentation}_S(Q,m,u,h;\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;m\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s),\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall s,s&#39;\\in T\\;(s\\leq s&#39;\\to\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s&#39;))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,m+1,T)\\land\\forall k&lt;m\\;(u(k)&lt;u(k+1))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,m,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k&lt;m\\;\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(h(k);(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(u(k))),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q,T\\times\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\nQ(\\langle s,w\\rangle)=\\sum_{k&lt;m}h(k)(w)\\mathbf1_{(u(k),u(k+1)]}(s).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SimplePredictable}_S(Q,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists m,u,h\\;\\mathrm{PredictableStepRepresentation}_S(Q,m,u,h;\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SimplePredictable}_S(Q,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists m,u,h\\;\\mathrm{PredictableStepRepresentation}_S(Q,m,u,h;\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SimpleItoIntegral}_t(J,Q,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists m,u,h\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PredictableStepRepresentation}_S(Q,m,u,h;\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land J=\\{\\langle w,\\sum_{k&lt;m}h(k)(w)\n[B(\\min(u(k+1),t))(w)-B(\\min(u(k),t))(w)]\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SimpleItoIntegral}_t(J,Q,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists m,u,h\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PredictableStepRepresentation}_S(Q,m,u,h;\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land J=\\{\\langle w,\\sum_{k&lt;m}h(k)(w)\n[B(\\min(u(k+1),t))(w)-B(\\min(u(k),t))(w)]\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ItoIntegrable}_t(H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Predictable}_S(H,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ItoIntegrable}_t(H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Predictable}_S(H,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t(Y,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{ItoIntegrable}_t(H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists Q\\in(\\mathbb R^{T\\times\\Omega})^\\omega\\;\n\\exists J\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{SimplePredictable}_S(Q(n),\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{33mm}\\land\\operatorname{SimpleItoIntegral}_t(J(n),Q(n),B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,Q(n)(\\langle s,w\\rangle)-H(\\langle s,w\\rangle)\\rangle:\ns\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\},t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle w,J(n)(w)-Y(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t(Y,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{ItoIntegrable}_t(H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists Q\\in(\\mathbb R^{T\\times\\Omega})^\\omega\\;\n\\exists J\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{SimplePredictable}_S(Q(n),\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{33mm}\\land\\operatorname{SimpleItoIntegral}_t(J(n),Q(n),B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,Q(n)(\\langle s,w\\rangle)-H(\\langle s,w\\rangle)\\rangle:\ns\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\},t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle w,J(n)(w)-Y(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原有限简单和及平方均值逼近定义，不改成局部随机积分或概率收敛定义。输出为可测实函数，而不是商空间的等价类；几乎处处相等的不同代表仍可同时满足关系。</li>\n<li>原 <code>BrownianMotion_S</code> 未被加强；等距定理另须使用 <code>BrownianWithFiltration_S</code>，不能从适应性单独推出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Karatzas and Shreve, Brownian Motion and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n<li>Øksendal, Stochastic Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-predictable.md","status":"resolved","id":"7934599233a4e10f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-predictable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Measurable}$ 取 [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-predictable.md","status":"resolved","id":"7934599233a4e10f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Predictable}$ 取 [[../batch11/58-df-predictable.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}$ 取 [[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"B,H,Q,J,Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,m,u,h\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"T\\times\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"Q(s,w)","display":false},{"tex":"Q(\\langle s,w\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{u(k)}=\\mathcal F_\\bullet(u(k))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_A(s)=1","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_A(s)=0","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Predictable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PredictableStepRepresentation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PredictableStepRepresentation}_S(Q,m,u,h;\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&m\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,T,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s),\\Omega)\n\\land\\forall s,s'\\in T\\;(s\\leq s'\\to\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\subseteq\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s'))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,m+1,T)\\land\\forall k<m\\;(u(k)<u(k+1))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,m,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k<m\\;\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(h(k);(\\Omega,\\mathcal F_\\bullet(u(k))),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q,T\\times\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\nQ(\\langle s,w\\rangle)=\\sum_{k<m}h(k)(w)\\mathbf1_{(u(k),u(k+1)]}(s).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SimplePredictable}_S(Q,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists m,u,h\\;\\mathrm{PredictableStepRepresentation}_S(Q,m,u,h;\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SimpleItoIntegral}_t(J,Q,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists m,u,h\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PredictableStepRepresentation}_S(Q,m,u,h;\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land J=\\{\\langle w,\\sum_{k<m}h(k)(w)\n[B(\\min(u(k+1),t))(w)-B(\\min(u(k),t))(w)]\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ItoIntegrable}_t(H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Predictable}_S(H,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\\\\n&\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t(Y,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{ItoIntegrable}_t(H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists Q\\in(\\mathbb R^{T\\times\\Omega})^\\omega\\;\n\\exists J\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{SimplePredictable}_S(Q(n),\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&\\hspace{33mm}\\land\\operatorname{SimpleItoIntegral}_t(J(n),Q(n),B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,Q(n)(\\langle s,w\\rangle)-H(\\langle s,w\\rangle)\\rangle:\ns\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\},t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus N\\;\n\\exists r\\in[0,\\varepsilon)\\;\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S\\left(r,\n\\{\\langle w,J(n)(w)-Y(w)\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P\\right)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":5374,"backlinks":[{"id":"fe4afc670ec37a7e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"211a4101b02c699d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"44af585e6fa080e5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t\\subseteq V^7$ (上游 $L^2$ 极限定义, see [[58-df-stochastic-integral]])"},{"id":"9b271ecc61952593","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1227","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral.md|58-df-stochastic-integral]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["948f8f3178040b74","36d7463d215be751","7934599233a4e10f","bbbec05fde1d3b01","b91a21e76d0947e0","a740bdad87b97ac6"]}